<title>USA: American Express Travel unit names new CFO.</title>
<headline>American Express Travel unit names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Express Co said on Wednesday it named John McDonnell chief financial officer for American Express Travel Related Services Inc effective immediately.</p>
<p>McDonnell has worked for the company for 18 years, American Express said. He would focus on forming a cohesive team within Travel Related Services finance and continuing to develop utility functions across all business units, it said.</p>
<p>McDonnel replaced Walter Berman, who left the company.</p>
